ropdown when /projects fails\n FAIL  src/App.test.ts > App connection flows > renders the daemon health panel on #/health when /health answers\nSvelte error: effect_orphan\n`$effect` can only be used inside an effect (e.g. during component initialisation)\nhttps://svelte.dev/e/effect_orphan\n\n\tin <unknown>\n\n ❯ App src/App.svelte:19:3\n     17|   let showPalette = $state(false)\n     18| \n     19|   $effect(() => {\n       |   ^\n     20|     const onHash = () => (route = parseHash(location.hash))\n     21|     window.addEventListener('hashchange', onHash)\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[1/5]⎯\n\n\n Test Files  1 failed (1)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"npx vitest run src/App.test.ts 2>&1 | grep -B2 -A18 \"FAIL\\|AssertionError\" | head -80","time":{"start":1787993390259,"end":1787993390264}},"id":"prt_04cb5f136001er1jiIEdVS1qpQ","sessionID":"ses_fb3594f94ffeQ3bCtRbhDqaOUL","messageID":"msg_04cb559b8001XgtwvIMs4mtQER"}}
