{"type":"text","timestamp":1787994062047,"sessionID":"ses_fb3457eb3fferiW9S1l2qfOUfr","part":{"id":"prt_04cc029980017EspRgGqRotSIw","messageID":"msg_04cbf682c001T4wZ0d42swo9cA","sessionID":"ses_fb3457eb3fferiW9S1l2qfOUfr","type":"text","text":"**Confirmed — dramatically**: the effect loops so hot that Node OOM-crashes. A healthy daemon with an empty registry (exactly the user's host) makes `projects = []` retrigger the effect endlessly. The fix: load projects on connection *establishment* (a transition edge), not on \"list is empty\". Let me implement:","time":{"start":1787994057112,"end":1787994062045}}}
