 proxy path and why absolute URLs are blocked\n    - offline banner: let the (now longer) message wrap instead of truncating\n    - README: document the /api dev flow\n    - tests: cover the CORS-detection branch (cross-origin vs same-origin)\n\n web-ui/README.md                                   |  16 +++++++----\n .../127-0-0-1-5199-mock-1-p-manigot-1280.png       | Bin 125144 -> 0 bytes\n .../127-0-0-1-5199-mock-1-p-manigot-375.png        | Bin 78186 -> 0 bytes\n .../127-0-0-1-5199-mock-1-p-manigot-768.png        | Bin 112461 -> 0 bytes\n ...p-manigot-j-farmer-part-2-of-web-ui-tu-1280.png | Bin 129611 -> 0 bytes\n ...-p-manigot-j-farmer-part-2-of-web-ui-tu-375.png | Bin 86892 -> 0 bytes\n ...-p-manigot-j-farmer-part-2-of-web-ui-tu-768.png | Bin 62691 -> 0 bytes\n .../127-0-0-1-5200-api-api-p-fixture-1280.png      | Bin 75284 -> 0 bytes\n ...-p-fixture-j-inquiry-fixture-test-job--1280.png | Bin 80358 -> 0 bytes\n web-ui/src/App.svelte                              |   5 ++--\n web-ui/src/lib/api/client.test.ts                  |  30 +++++++++++++++++++++\n web-ui/src/lib/api/client.ts                       |  24 ++++++++++++++++-\n web-ui/src/lib/components/SettingsModal.svelte     |  11 ++++++--\n 13 files changed, 75 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)\n","metadata":{"output":"commit d9a0f23dcfec2d5c3da9d11d111784e7b55f4400\nAuthor: Leander Muskalla <muskalla@sozialit.de>\nDate:   Fri Aug 28 21:27:16 2026 +0000\n\n    web-ui: real-daemon verification fixes, README, and node_modules hygiene\n    \n    - fix job-file requests to match the shipped daemon (files/<name>.md, not\n      files/<name>) and mirror that in the mock backend\n    - add ?api= URL param for deep-linking the UI at a daemon\n    - README with run/dev/test instructions and design notes\n    - .gitignore for node_modules/dist; untrack the accidentally committed\n      web-ui/node_modules (4372 files) and web-ui/dist\n    - commit analyst's listener.md gap annotation; drop stray draft briefs\n    - verif