r Muskalla <muskalla@sozialit.de>\nDate:   Fri Aug 28 21:41:04 2026 +0000\n\n    web-ui: surface the CORS block precisely and point to the /api proxy path\n    \n    The daemon is deliberately a same-origin JSON API (no CORS headers), so a\n    cross-origin absolute URL in the connection settings can never work from a\n    browser — the request dies in the preflight with no response, which fetch\n    reports as a bare 'Failed to fetch'. The UI previously wrapped that in a\n    generic 'Could not reach the daemon — check the URL', sending the user\n    hunting for a URL typo that isn't there.\n    \n    - client: detect when the configured base URL is a different origin and\n      report 'cross-origin URL blocked by the browser … in dev set the URL to\n      /api (vite proxies it to 127.0.0.1:8080)' instead of the raw fetch error\n    - SettingsModal: show the precise error in the toast; hint text now\n      documents the /api proxy path and why absolute URLs are blocked\n    - offline banner: let the (now longer) message wrap instead of truncating\n    - README: document the /api dev flow\n    - tests: cover the CORS-detection branch (cross-origin vs same-origin)\n\n web-ui/README.md                                   |  16 +++++++----\n .../127-0-0-1-5199-mock-1-p-manigot-1280.png       | Bin 125144 -> 0 bytes\n .../127-0-0-1-5199-mock-1-p-manigot-375.png        | Bin 78186 -> 0 bytes\n .../127-0-0-1-5199-mock-1-p-manigot-768.png        | Bin 112461 -> 0 bytes\n ...p-manigot-j-farmer-part-2-of-web-ui-tu-1280.png | Bin 129611 -> 0 bytes\n ...-p-manigot-j-farmer-part-2-of-web-ui-tu-375.png | Bin 86892 -> 0 bytes\n ...-p-manigot-j-farmer-part-2-of-web-ui-tu-768.png | Bin 62691 -> 0 bytes\n .../127-0-0-1-5200-api-api-p-fixture-1280.png      | Bin 75284 -> 0 bytes\n ...-p-fixture-j-inquiry-fixture-test-job--1280.png | Bin 80358 -> 0 bytes\n web-ui/src/App.svelte                              |   5 ++--\n web-ui/src/lib/api/client.test.ts                  |  30 +++++++++++