tes this as tasks complete.\\n312:             {:else if tab === 'verdict'}The reviewer writes this after review.\\n313:             {:else}The brief is the job's first file.{/if}\\n314:           </p>\\n315:         </div>\\n316:       {:else}\\n317:         <MarkdownView source={fileContent} />\\n318:         {#if tab === 'brief'}\\n319:           <div class=\\\"file-actions\\\">\\n320:             <button class=\\\"btn\\\" onclick={startEdit}>Edit brief</button>\\n321:           </div>\\n322:         {/if}\\n323:         {#if tab === 'verdict' && verdict}\\n324:           <p class=\\\"verdict-line\\\" class:approved={verdictApproved} class:rejected={!verdictApproved}>\\n325:             Verdict: {verdict}\\n326:           </p>\\n327:         {/if}\\n328:       {/if}\\n329:     {/if}\\n330:   </div>\\n331: </div>\\n332: \\n333: {#if showAgents}\\n334:   <Modal title=\\\"Launch agent\\\" onclose={() => (showAgents = false)} width=\\\"560px\\\">\\n335:     <p class=\\\"launch-hint\\\">\\n336:       One detached run in the job's worktree — its output lands in <code>session.log</code> and the\\n337:       Run tab. Interactive sessions stay in the terminal by design.\\n338:     </p>\\n339:     <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n340:       <label for=\\\"launch-profile\\\">profile</label>\\n341:       <select id=\\\"launch-profile\\\" class=\\\"select\\\" bind:value={profile}>\\n342:         <option value=\\\"\\\">daemon default</option>\\n343:         <option value=\\\"claude-pro\\\">claude-pro</option>\\n344:         <option value=\\\"zai\\\">zai</option>\\n345:         <option value=\\\"opencode-go\\\">opencode-go</option>\\n346:         <option value=\\\"opencode-zen\\\">opencode-zen</option>\\n347:         <option value=\\\"opencode-zen-free\\\">opencode-zen-free</option>\\n348:       </select>\\n349:     </div>\\n350:     <input class=\\\"input\\\" placeholder=\\\"Filter the crew…\\\" bind:value={agentQuery} spellcheck=\\\"false\\\" aria-label=\\\"Filter agents\\\" />\\n